  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preventing demand for deforestation-causing biofuels in the aviation and shipping sectors</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of this project is to prevent the adoption of policies that would drive the uptake of deforestation-causing biofuels in the aviation and shipping sectors in the EU, US and at international level.</narrative>
  </description>
